  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:05.880" end="00:08.370" ttm:agent="v1">I will be your dentist</p>
      <p begin="00:08.370" end="00:11.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Go off, DTM)</p>
      <p begin="00:11.250" end="00:12.750" ttm:agent="v1">First date I was talking my game</p>
      <p begin="00:12.700" end="00:14.200" ttm:agent="v1">And she was with it</p>
      <p begin="00:13.830" end="00:15.540" ttm:agent="v1">Had her smiling when the second one came</p>
      <p begin="00:15.540" end="00:17.040" ttm:agent="v1">She catching feelings</p>
      <p begin="00:16.560" end="00:18.590" ttm:agent="v1">By the third date, I took her breath away</p>
      <p begin="00:18.590" end="00:20.090" ttm:agent="v1">She sat there gigging</p>
      <p begin="00:19.380" end="00:21.100" ttm:agent="v1">At the end, I got nothing else to say</p>
      <p begin="00:21.100" end="00:23.690" ttm:agent="v1">I got a shawty and she bad</p>
      <p begin="00:23.690" end="00:25.190" ttm:agent="v1">Miss get to the bag</p>
      <p begin="00:25.060" end="00:27.140" ttm:agent="v1">Thrill seeker, she just wanna move it fast</p>
      <p begin="00:27.140" end="00:29.190" ttm:agent="v1">And my shawty she bad</p>
      <p begin="00:29.190" end="00:30.690" ttm:agent="v1">On cam, throw it back</p>
      <p begin="00:30.690" end="00:32.190" ttm:agent="v1">Get that bread by any means</p>
      <p begin="00:31.930" end="00:34.800" ttm:agent="v1">Shake that ass, 'cause my shawty she bad</p>
      <p begin="00:34.800" end="00:36.360" ttm:agent="v1">She finesse with the cash</p>
      <p begin="00:36.360" end="00:38.090" ttm:agent="v1">Got them other folks feindin' for her mad</p>
      <p begin="00:38.090" end="00:40.670" ttm:agent="v1">Reel it in, she got a catch</p>
      <p begin="00:40.670" end="00:42.170" ttm:agent="v1">No cap, no cap</p>
      <p begin="00:41.890" end="00:43.840" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, she lovin' all the ways that I act</p>
      <p begin="00:43.840" end="00:46.000" ttm:agent="v1">Got a shawty and she bad</p>
      <p begin="00:46.000" end="00:47.500" ttm:agent="v1">She told me I'm her type</p>
      <p begin="00:47.410" end="00:50.190" ttm:agent="v1">She on a high when we together, enter hyperdrive</p>
      <p begin="00:50.190" end="00:52.210" ttm:agent="v1">She caught a big vibe, this time, been like</p>
      <p begin="00:52.210" end="00:55.220" ttm:agent="v1">How I be spittin', wanna sit by and lie all times</p>
      <p begin="00:55.220" end="00:57.300" ttm:agent="v1">Right there beside me like right now</p>
      <p begin="00:57.300" end="00:58.830" ttm:agent="v1">Come down, baby, leg's battle</p>
      <p begin="00:58.830" end="01:00.750" ttm:agent="v1">Everyone pipe down, they out</p>
      <p begin="01:00.750" end="01:02.800" ttm:agent="v1">No one can handle, she like a star now</p>
      <p begin="01:02.800" end="01:05.820" ttm:agent="v1">She been the center of attention soon as I pop out</p>
      <p begin="01:05.820" end="01:07.320" ttm:agent="v1">It ain't no regular visit</p>
      <p begin="01:07.230" end="01:09.950" ttm:agent="v1">She live the best life, fast life she don't wanna leave it</p>
      <p begin="01:09.950" end="01:12.720" ttm:agent="v1">When it's the pasttime, pastime, she goin' out drinkin'</p>
      <p begin="01:12.720" end="01:15.560" ttm:agent="v1">She got them big dreams, she living life that she mean it</p>
      <p begin="01:15.560" end="01:18.300" ttm:agent="v1">Before she's six feet under, she live like a demon</p>
      <p begin="01:18.300" end="01:19.900" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause she bad</p>
      <p begin="01:19.900" end="01:21.400" ttm:agent="v1">Miss get to the bag</p>
      <p begin="01:21.350" end="01:23.580" ttm:agent="v1">Thrill seeker, she just wanna move it fast</p>
      <p begin="01:23.580" end="01:25.690" ttm:agent="v1">And my shawty she bad</p>
      <p begin="01:25.690" end="01:27.250" ttm:agent="v1">On cam, throw it back</p>
      <p begin="01:27.250" end="01:28.750" ttm:agent="v1">Get that bread by any means</p>
      <p begin="01:28.440" end="01:31.240" ttm:agent="v1">Shake that ass, 'cause my shawty bad</p>
      <p begin="01:31.240" end="01:32.740" ttm:agent="v1">She finesse with the cash</p>
      <p begin="01:32.640" end="01:34.840" ttm:agent="v1">Got them other folks feindin' for her mad</p>
      <p begin="01:34.840" end="01:36.880" ttm:agent="v1">Reel it in, she got the cash</p>
      <p begin="01:36.880" end="01:38.380" ttm:agent="v1">No cap, no cap</p>
      <p begin="01:38.240" end="01:40.410" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch she lovin' all the ways that I act</p>
      <p begin="01:40.410" end="01:41.910" ttm:agent="v1">Got a shawty and she</p>
      <p begin="01:41.470" end="01:45.470" ttm:agent="v1"/>
    </div>
